<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Riggs started as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Riggs started as buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Hilliard Lyons banking analyst Alan Morel said he started coverage of Riggs National Corp with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- While it its recovering from real estate exposure in the 1980s, &quot;RIGS is a strongly capitalized, efficient organization,&quot; Morel said.</p>
<p>--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
